Package: xfce4-sysribbon-plugin
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xfce4-panel
Description: compact configurable system monitor for the Xfce panel
 SysRibbon displays CPU, RAM, temperature and network statistics in the
 Xfce panel. It offers configurable sampling rates, tiny history graphs,
 thresholds, scalable graphs and a minimal numeric view.
